sentences.text:
This petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India has been filed seeking following reliefs:-
a. To declare the Order dated 23.11.2019 passed by Respondent No. 3 (Annexure P/2)
as being violative of the fundamental rights of the Petitioner and set aside the same;
b. To direct the Respondents to expedite the process of grant of compensation awarded to the Petitioner by Respondent No. 2 (Annexure P/1);
c. Any other relief that may be deem fit.
